{'symbol': 'BA', 'date': '2023-03-15 10:00:00', 'title': 'BOEING FORECASTS RESILIENCY AND INCREASED GROWTH FOR AIRCRAFT FINANCE', 'text': 'SEATTLE , MARCH 15, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- BOEING [NYSE: BA] TODAY RELEASED THE 2023 COMMERCIAL AIRCRAFT FINANCE MARKET OUTLOOK (CAFMO) SHOWING ANOTHER YEAR OF RECOVERY AND INCREASED DEMAND FROM AIRCRAFT FINANCIERS AND INVESTORS. "WITH PRODUCTION AND DELIVERY INCREASES AND THE REOPENING OF CERTAIN REGIONAL MARKETS, WE FORECAST AIRCRAFT FINANCING NEEDS TO REACH NEAR PRE-PANDEMIC LEVELS IN 2023," SAID RICH HAMMOND, VICE PRESIDENT OF CUSTOMER FINANCE AT BOEING.'}